The '''Trawormatt Mountains''' were a [[mountain]] range which was located on the [[Outer Rim Territories|Outer Rim]] [[planet]] [[Ossus]].<ref name="MandoVG" />

{{Loc-stub}}

==Behind the scenes==
The Trawormatt Mountains first appeared, albeit unidentified, in "[[Chapter 6: From the Desert Comes a Stranger]]," the sixth episode of the live-action [[Disney+]] series ''[[Star Wars: The Book of Boba Fett]]'',<ref name="BoBF6">{{BOBF|Chapter 6: From the Desert Comes a Stranger}}</ref> which was released on [[February 2]], [[2022]].<ref name="D23">{{D23|url=everything-new-you-can-stream-on-disney-in-february-2022|text=Everything New You Can Stream on Disney+ in February 2022}}</ref> The mountains received its name within the [[2026]] reference book ''[[Star Wars: The Mandalorian Visual Guide]]''.<ref name="MandoVG" /> Despite the book being first published on [[April 2]] of that year,<ref name="DK UK">{{DK|url=products/9780241791295-star-wars-the-mandalorian-visual-guide|text=Star Wars The Mandalorian Visual Guide}}</ref> a relevant extract identifying the mountains was previewed at the [[Wikipedia:New York Comic Con|New York Comic Con]] on [[October 11]], [[2025]].<ref name="NYCC 2025">{{SW|url=news/nycc-2025-lucasfilm-publishing-reveals|text=NYCC 2025: All the News and Reveals from the Lucasfilm Publishing Panel}}</ref>

